ross alien landscapes. And explore planets each accompanied by their own soulful soundtrack.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187450/extras/7d93cad35c131655f906ad5f77f59d87.avif?t=1738243097\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Indie Rock Score: Lose yourself in the raw and emotional melodies of Asterism's indie-rock soundtrack, featuring vocals and gritty electric guitar composed &amp; performed by solo developer Claire Morwood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Handcrafted Visuals: Explore a stunning world where digital &amp; analogue techniques collide, featuring stop-motion ships, collage landscapes, and hand-drawn characters across a vibrant solar system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Rich Narrative: Embark on a profound journey of discovery and introspection with a deeply emotional narrative that delves into themes of personal expression, self-acceptance, anxiety, and mental health.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187450/extras/fa75532dc9c02b8126b3aece514a2a06.poster.avif?t=1738243097\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187450/extras/fa75532dc9c02b8126b3aece514a2a06.webm?t=1738243097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187450/extras/fa75532dc9c02b8126b3aece514a2a06.mp4?t=1738243097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187450/extras/2ca069dfbf8915938469e60ca95af031.webp?t=1738243097\" width=600 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Simple Controls: Asterism uses simple and intuitive controls making it easy to pick up and difficult to put down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀Album Length Experience: Asterism is designed to be played in a single sitting, with approximately 2 hours of gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187450/extras/b6a64ca0fd9707974977fc857be36a36.avif?t=1738243097\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo developer, Claire Morwood, has meticulously crafted nearly every aspect of Asterism, from folding origami avatars &amp; moulding clay lighthouses to writing &amp; voicing the soundtrack. A culmination of years of exploration and experimentation, Asterism is a labour of love and passion that sits at the intersection of music, art, and digital storytelling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187450/extras/a1d482f0c2c414f5b66c9c8cd4654c35.avif?t=1738243097\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187450/extras/615a01492fef01563c649b9b2176687c.webp?t=1738243097\" width=600 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Asterism was inspired by the feeling of sitting on the window seat of a bus, music echoing in your ears, as you glimpse momentary details amidst the blur of passing lights.”</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claire is a self-taught game designer, artist, programmer, &amp; co-creator of the BAFTA-nominated game <i>Before I Forget</i> (3-Fold Games). She is passionate about empowering others through workshops on game development, particularly in creating personal games using small tools like Bitsy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s